{
  "description": "Operations a repeated activity (threshold) audit log alert may count, per log. Only operations where many in a short time means something: deletion, downloads, sharing, exports, permission and account changes. High-volume reads (FileAccessed, MailItemsAccessed, MessageSent) and failed sign-ins, whose sprays use a new username each time, are left out. Keep identical to frontend/src/data/AuditLogRepeatedActivityOperations.json.",
